fix: load live sessions + reference-accurate visuals + user-anchored keys

Core: inject the sessions service into the client half. Previously the
dynamic client ctx threw "cannot get property 'sessions' without inject"
and the piano bar silently rendered its empty state.

Visuals (pixel-measured from ref_picture via sharp):
- fixed 10px key pitch, 2px bars, 6px resting / 26px hovered (4.3x),
  ladder 20/14/10 (77%/54%/38%)
- key cluster vertically centered in the message area; compresses to 6px
  pitch on overflow
- palette: light #D2D3D3/#767779/#1A1C1F, dark #454545/#A3A3A3/#FFFFFF;
  active highlight is color-only (no blue, no lengthening, no dot)

Tooltip: one key per user message (user + steering); preview shows the
user line plus the same-turn model reply, capped at 3 lines via width-model
JS truncation with an explicit ellipsis + -webkit-line-clamp fallback.

Docs: bilingual README (zh/en), package 0.2.0, curated dev/test scripts.
